{"abstract":"FIFA-serien er blevet til FC-serien, men har derudover ikke ændret sig meget. Det er stadig et fremragende fodboldspil, og der er stadigvæk fuld fokus på mikrotransaktioner og den uendelige og umulige jagt på drømmeholdet.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Nielsen, Rune Kristian Lundedal"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-695228"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["EA Sports FC","FIFA series rebranding","football simulation game","microtransactions in video games","ultimate team mode"],"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"ea sports fc 000000000024","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://tjekspillet.dk/fc-24/","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-695228","ids":["itu-1e4f8a06-72e9-4939-aa0f-ffa749d507e0"],"keyword":["EA Sports FC","FIFA series rebranding","football simulation game","microtransactions in video games","ultimate team mode"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-F76E3552A01787A624C705B54DC502E2"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://tjekspillet.dk/fc-24/","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Design","IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Design, Play, Culture and AI Section","IT University of Copenhagen, Play, Culture, and AI, Games Research Group"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"R