{"abstract":"FIFA var oprindeligt en fodboldsimulation men i takt med, at spillet har udviklet sig, er produktet gået fra at være ét spil til at være en platform med mange forskellige spiltyper (også kaldet game modes). Fra år til år er der stor udskiftning i hvilke game modes, der er med på platformen.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Nielsen, Rune Kristian Lundedal"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-695248"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["FIFA simulation","Platform evolution","annual content updates","game modes variability","multifaceted gaming experience"],"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"fifa","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://tjekspillet.dk/fifa/","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-695248","ids":["itu-61b28ae4-53df-491d-99e8-615ac8b3b5c4"],"keyword":["FIFA simulation","annual content updates","game modes variability","multifaceted gaming experience","platform evolution"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-F08718643FE454568F263BE31C99C7FB"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://tjekspillet.dk/fifa/","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Design","IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Design, Play, Culture and AI Section","IT University of Copenhagen, Play, Culture, and AI, Games Research Group"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"p