{"abstract":"Candy Crush Saga er et hovedbrudsspil, hvor man skal skal flytte rundt på slikstykker på et bræt for at skabe sekvenser af ens stykker slik i stil med brætspilsklassikeren “Fire på Stribe”. Hver runde udfordrer spilleren på hver sin måde med f.eks. tidsbegrænsninger og begrænsede antal træk","author_count":1,"contributors":["Nielsen, Rune Kristian Lundedal"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-695241"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Board game mechanics","Candy Crush Saga","Game challenges","Puzzle games","Sequence matching"],"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"candy crush saga","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://tjekspillet.dk/candy-crush/","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-695241","ids":["itu-465e0640-4c93-49e0-9c6d-efad6f560589"],"keyword":["Board game mechanics","Candy Crush Saga","Game challenges","Puzzle games","Sequence matching"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-CE3415B9EB3C8E84A4C600B03227A6FE"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://tjekspillet.dk/candy-crush/","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Design","IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Design, Play, Culture and AI Section","IT University of Copenhagen, Play, Culture, and AI, Games Research Group"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corres