{"abstract":"Dansk forskning har skabt stor værdi i udviklingen af e-sporten samt bidraget til at ændre opfattelsen af sportens vækstpotentiale. Der er dog stadig meget, vi ikke ved endnu, som forskningen skal være med til at afdække, skriver en række forskere fra Aalborg, Aarhus og Københavns Universitet.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Straszek, Christian Lund Nørgaard","Østergaard, Lars Domino","Hanghøj, Thorkild","Fiskaali, Anne","Brus, Anne","Thorhauge, Anne Mette","Lundedal Nielsen, Rune Kristian"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-078845"],"filters":{"added":"2022-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Esports","Research"],"level":"pop","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CDR"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-UCN"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CDR","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU","DI-UC-UCN"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"forskere vi skal afdække e sportens skjulte vækstpotentiale","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"djc","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.altinget.dk/idraet/artikel/forskere-forskning-skal-afdaekke-e-sportens-skjulte-vaekstpotentiale","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-078845","ids":["aau-6330b558-2068-401d-8920-16998ee83d5d"],"keyword":["esports","research"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-06C08F9207EAB1AC468D9DF8291F1685"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.altinget.dk/idraet/artikel/forskere-forskning-skal-afdaekke-e-sportens-skjulte-vaekstpotentiale","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalbor