{"abstract":"Esports is on the rise as a leisure activity and also as a pedagogical activity. In this paper, we explore how Danish teachers within special needs education experience the pedagogical possibilities and challenges related to the educational use of esports activities. More specifically, we interviewed teachers from four different public institutions and a teacher from a commercial esports provider that offers specially organized education aimed at young people (16-25 years old) diagnosed with autism spectrum disorder. The results indicate that teachers generally have positive experiences with esports activities using Counter-Strike: Global Offensive (CS:GO) in relation to increasing students’ well-being and social relations. However, there are also clear differences in the teachers’ game literacy, as well as how they facilitate game activities through their own teaching or by visits to an external esports provider. The findings suggest that esports activities can be used as a valuable teaching resource, but that this requires expertise, ownership, and awareness among teachers of the educational possibilities and challenges.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Nielsen, Rune Kristian Lundedal","Hanghøj, Thorkild","Boller, Morten","Mollerup, Peter"],"cuid":["S02-087.07-007886"],"event":{"acronym":"FGD(?)","end":"2021-08-06","place":"Fully Online","start":"2021-08-03","title":"The 16th International Conference on the Foundations of Digital Games (FDG) 2021","year":"2021"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Autisme","Esports Autism Self Determination Theory Structured Gaming","Motivation","Undervisning","eSport"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"teaching esports to young students with autism exploring pedagogical possibilities and challenges","src":["aau","itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/86414868/FDG2021_Teaching_esports_to_young_students.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S02-087.07-007886","identifier":[{"id":"85118249382","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-a337d284-1a3c-4efc-b09c-cc7277bbaab4","itu-37075ae1-5435-4563-97e1-a86f339f7d41"],"keyword":["Esports, Autism, Self-Determination Theory, Structured Gaming","Motivation","Undervisning","autisme","esport"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-AE24F09C0321E1E5030BEDF2C45BFC91"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/86414868/FDG2021_Teaching_esports_to_young_students.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Design","IT University of Copenhagen, Play, Culture, and AI, Games Research Group"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, Kommunikation - IT og Læringsdesign","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Culture and Learning, ILD-LAB – Research lab for IT and Learning Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology, The Center for Applied Game Research"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Rune Kristian Lundedal","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"80784458-06f6-4eff-b0c8-df982ffa9835","name":"Nielsen, Rune Kristian Lundedal","orcid":"0000-0002-7209-9041","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Thorkild","key":"hanghøjpau","last":"Hanghøj","locid":"f14a3800-5086-4fa8-880e-ac0725c8756d","name":"Hanghøj, Thorkild","orcid":"0000-0001-8053-8377","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Morten","key":"bollerpau","last":"Boller","locid":"9fd69220-87e6-4e22-964b-f56271bfe9b1","name":"Boller, Morten","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Peter","key":"molleruppau","last":"Mollerup","locid":"6d1ccb47-a2fd-438c-8214-108fd967167f","name":"Mollerup, Peter","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Allan","key":"fowlerpedh","last":"Fowler","name":"Fowler, Allan","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Johanna","key":"pirkerpedh","last":"Pirker","name":"Pirker, Johanna","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Alesandro A.","key":"canossapedh","last":"Canossa","name":"Canossa, Alesandro A.","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Ali A.","key":"aryapedh","last":"Arya","name":"Arya, Ali A.","rank":8,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Casper","key":"harteveldpedh","last":"Harteveld","name":"Harteveld, Casper","rank":9,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/3472538.3472556","eisbn":["9781450384223"],"isbn"